{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":7},"Neneh Superstar","Née pour danser, Neneh est une petite fille noire de 12 ans qui rêve de rentrer à l’école de ballet de l’Opéra de Paris. Malgré son enthousiasme, elle va devoir redoubler d’efforts pour s’arracher à sa condition et se faire accepter par la directrice de l’établissement, Marianne Bellage. Cette dernière est en effet la garante des traditions et porteuse d’un secret qui la relie à la petite ballerine…",[4,5,6],"urban","education","high rank employment",{"type":8,"id":9,"slug":10,"title":11,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":26,"media":29,"synopsis":32,"production":34,"characters":37,"roles":38,"awards":87,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_025","fr2023-025-neneh-superstar",{"native":1,"english":1},{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release","2023-01-25",2023,"Fiction film",[18],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Ramzi Ben Sliman","ramzi-ben-sliman",1982,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[27,28],"Comedy","Drama",{"posterUrl":30,"trailerUrl":31},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/15/236/257039/format_page/neneh-superstar.png","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UovqZK89cL8",{"native":2,"english":33},"",[35],{"country":24,"share":36},"Majority coproducer",[],[39,55,62,76,80],{"person":40,"role":54},{"id":41,"slug":42,"name":41,"birthYear":43,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":44},"Cédric Kahn","cedric-kahn",1966,[45],{"film":46,"year":50,"award":51,"category":52,"result":53},{"slug":47,"title":48},"fr2023-167-le-proces-goldman",{"native":49},"Le Procès Goldman",2024,"César du cinéma","Best Director","Nominated","Minor actor/Cameo",{"person":56,"role":54},{"id":57,"slug":58,"name":57,"birthYear":59,"deathYear":22,"gender":60,"nationality":24,"awards":61},"Marilyne Canto","marilyne-canto",1961,"Female identifying",[],{"person":63,"role":54},{"id":64,"slug":65,"name":